WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.490
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm a sixth grader,

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:37.700
who's also active as an entertainer.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:41.080
Sagami Rei-kun. He's both my
chauffeur and my manager,

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.370
as well as my boyfriend and pimp!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:46.370
Mama. She's an Aoki Laureate novelist
who keeps a chipmunk on her head.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.710
This... is a mysterious white bat.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:53.300
And this is the fiend who is in my class,
6th Grade 3rd Class, Hayama Akito!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.050
He's like the devil!

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.720
Thanks to Hayama,
our class is a shambles!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.470
I finally declared war on him!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.010
I win!

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.020
I lose.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.020
I win!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.680
I lose. And when it was over...

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.690
I took a picture of Hayama buck naked!

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.190
Now then, Hayama-kun...

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.780
How about you hand over that
picture of the teachers?

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:28.000
"Lone Wolf, Awooo!"

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.710
This is all of them?

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:36.170
T- these are the pictures of
the teachers... m- make-- making out...?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.630
Here, wipe your nose.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.640
They're pretty incredible, all right.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.970
Hayama, are you sure you
handed over all of them?

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.640
If you still have even one copy,
I'm releasing your naked picture!

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.980
I don't have any more.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:49.980
Really?

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:50.650
Yeah.

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:53.310
Really? Really...?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:53.980
Yeah.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.650
All right...

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.240
Well, starting today,
you're going to behave yourself!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:02.200
No more tormenting the teacher, or
interfering with the lesson. Got that!?

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.990
You can't disobey me!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:09.790
I've got a super-embarrassing naked
picture of you right here, after all.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.880
This feels great!

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:18.340
Fine with me.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.680
It's not like I did all that
because I liked it.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.350
It made those idiots happy,
so I just went along with them.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.020
It was strange to me how they bowed
down to me and did everything I said.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.270
Hold on! You can't tell me
it was like that!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:38.190
Although you're right, the boys in this
class certainly are dumber than monkeys.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.610
Ee-hee...

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.280
You enjoyed being the
boss monkey, didn't you?

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:47.620
And now you put on that face, saying
not to lump you in with those others!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.290
Everyone went along with you!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.250
Shut up! You called me here
this early in the morning!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.630
I don't want to hear any sermons!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.590
Coming at a time
when no one else was here

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.050
was supposed to have been
more convenient for you!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.550
Akito-kun...

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:11.770
I'm sorry, but lately, Akito-kun,
I think you've been going too far.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.020
I really am sorry.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.570
"So, did Hayama forgive him?"

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.990
Hayama-san, you're early, huh?

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.660
Good morning!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.320
What are we doing today?

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.660
--Hayama-san...!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.830
I'm done with it.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.500
Why don't you guys finally start
looking towards middle school,

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.290
and start concentrating on your studies?

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:41.300
Things keep escalating like this,
and your grades are going to be in danger.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.300
Wha--?

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.300
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.300
Hayama! Come here a second.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.640
What is it?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:52.310
Just hurry! If you don't
do what I tell you,

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.980
you're stripped.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.100
--Stripped?

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.690
Damn...

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.070
Stripped?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:14.210
Okay, Hayama-kun, you realize how
much trouble you've caused us, right?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.710
If you realize the extent
of everything you've done,

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.170
then apologize to everyone here!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.010
Come on.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.010
Come on!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.430
Come on! Come on! Come on!
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.600
Geez, I'm so sorry.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.930
You call that an apology!?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.270
You don't get it, do you!?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.940
S- Sana-chan is amazing!

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.940
Hmph! It serves him right!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.270
But isn't she overdoing it a little?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:46.280
Are you listening to me, Hayama!?
Say something! Hey! Come on! Hey!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.950
That hurts, you know!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:52.950
The hearts of us girls hurt even more!
They're all prickly, like on Cutey Honey!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.290
That's right!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:57.920
Apologize sincerely!
Especially to Mami-chan!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.890
I'm sorry. I won't do it any more.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:20.310
--Did you hear that? Did you hear that?
--Unbelievable!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.650
He did apologize!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.980
I did it!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.320
That does it, right?

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.780
Hayama, we're going to
take you at your word!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.660
Now have yourself a change
of heart, with a whack!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.320
Hayama-san...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.950
You break your promise,
and you're stripped!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.240
--Stripped!
--...apologized...

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:35.910
--If you're lying, you swallow
a thousand needles! Got that!?
--How sissy...!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.120
"Thump! Thump! Thump!"

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:57.770
Okay, class is begin...ning...

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:04.400
It'll be okay now, most likely. Look,
Kurata got the pictures from Hayama...

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:09.320
...she got the pictures
away from him! Okay?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.110
Can that be true?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.000
O- okay, Gomi-kun,
begin reading from page 26.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.000
Don't get too pleased with yourself.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.340
What are you doing!?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.630
Read!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.130
Hayama-san...

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.600
"A peaceful class"

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:40.940
"Over the mountains, far to travel,
people say, Happiness dwells."

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:41.940
Oooooh...

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.940
Sensei, geez, what are you doing crying?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.940
Your Sensei is just so happy...

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.280
We need to hurry and get back the parts
where we're falling behind, right Sensei?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.950
R- right.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.910
So, what happened then?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.830
Sana-chan's fans from awl over
the country have been worried

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.620
about how Sana-chan is
doing at school, and look!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.290
This many postcards
have arrived for her!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.960
Oh my, how nice.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.300
Everyone all over the country,
I'm sorry to have worried you.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.630
Oh, didja manage to settle things?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.090
All settled, all settled.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:19.310
Zenjiro-sensei, you have a fairly
big problem keeping things private.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.640
So that's how it gets back to me, huh?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:23.310
It's so refreshing, like the
scales have fallen from my nose.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:25.980
No, no, scales fawl from
your eyes, don't they?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.980
Eh? You've got scales on your eyes!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.650
Dummy, like you've got them on your nose?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.570
Well, all's well that ends well.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.570
That's good to hear.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.450
What do you mean, all's well?

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.750
"The monkey has left,
but there's a new monkey!"

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:47.170
Yikes! Here I can finally have
class in peace, and I'm tardy again!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.130
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:55.430
Stop this! Please, stop this!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.430
Hayama! You broke your promise,
didn't you!?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:06.940
You liar! Liar! Liar! Liar!
Now, you're going to get stripped!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.610
I'm going to hand them out all over!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.610
I haven't done anything.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.280
Who's going to believe a lie like that!?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:18.280
Sana-chan, it looks like there's
a new faction that's started.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.280
Gomi-kun is the leader of this one.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.620
What?

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.620
Gomi-kun there?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.870
The boss monkey has been switched out.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.170
"Retiring"

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.170
Boss monkey... switch!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:34.670
Is this any time to be saying that!?
Put a stop to it, former boss monkey!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.260
Hey.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.930
Why don't you give it up.
Aren't you getting tired of it?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.690
Hmph. I'm not listening
to what you say any more.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.940
What's so funny!?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.940
Up until yesterday,
you were kissing up to me.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.950
Shut up! The truth is, I hate you!
You're always so high and mighty!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.950
Starting today, I'm the boss!

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.830
Let's clearly determine right
now which one of us is stronger!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.290
H- Hayama...

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.630
Come on! I'll show you
that I'm the stronger one!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:14.960
Hold on! Hold on! Why is it
turning out like this!? Stop!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.300
Here goes!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:19.840
No! Hayama, you absolutely
cannot use violence!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.480
Akito-kun, are you all right?

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.900
Sheesh! Listen to what girls
tell you, will you? Pathetic!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:35.900
Why, you...

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:39.610
Uh oh, he's snapped, he's snapped.
This is bad, this is bad...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.160
Both of you, don't fight!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.910
Hayama, if you use violence,
you'll be stripped! Stripped!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:46.910
Wha--?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.620
Your guard is down!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.250
Only Hayama-kun is listening to
what you're saying, Sana-chan.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.590
He's getting pounded on!

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.590
Stop it! You can't fight!
Don't do it, I tell you!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.590
Stop!

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.680
You're no challenge at all!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.600
Geez! Why didn't you dodge
his good-for-nothing punches!?

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:16.280
I'm not proud to say this,
but I'm not very good at defense.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.610
That really isn't
something to be proud of.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:23.950
Did you see that? Hayama is just a wuss,
who can't go against what girls say!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:30.290
All right! I'll let you have
one shot! Fight! One shot!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:33.960
Listen, starting today,
I'm the boss. Got that?

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.790
Yes, Gomi-san.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.960
Hey.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.100
This is supposed to be
a Shojo (girls') anime!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.310
Get all full of yourself, will you?

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.320
Incredible. Just one punch...

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.990
I guess Gomi's reign
only lasted for one period.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.320
But still, violence is wrong.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.990
You're the one who said just one
punch would be okay, weren't you!?

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.660
Hayama-san!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.000
I'm going to follow
Hayama-san after all!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.670
Don't follow me. You bother me.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.380
--Hayama-san...!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.340
Hayama-san is the boss after all, huh?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.000
Yeah!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.920
--Thanks to Hayama's one punch,
--If Hayama-san behaves himself,

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.010
--the other boys started
behaving themselves.
--I'll follow him!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.010
Damn...

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.010
Okay, let's use the pattern
marked with the "X."

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:29.350
The problems of 6th Grade
3rd Class had been solved...

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.180
...or so it appeared...

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.660
Sana-chan, do you know
where Akito-kun is?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.540
No, I don't. What's wrong?

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.750
I was supposed to meet up with him,
but he's not here.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.880
Geez, he always takes off somewhere...

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:07.260
As the days go by, he's been more
or less isolating himself, huh?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.850
"'Grrrr...' Lone Boy"

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.930
A lone wolf who's given up
being boss monkey!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.190
What's that?

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.400
Dunno.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.230
You should just leave that guy alone!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.190
He may be behaving himself now,

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.860
but remember what he was
doing up until recently!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.870
It's still upsetting, isn't it?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.170
Sana-chan, Sana-chan...!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.500
Sana-chan, it's your turn.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.590
Here goes!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.850
Sana-chan, watch out!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:14:00.980
Ee-yow-ow-ow!
An actress' face is her life!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:04.440
Why do I have to go through
something this painful!?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.110
That's right, that's right!
It's all his fault!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.200
He's the one that has me so distressed!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:15.870
I'm still upset, even now, about him!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.040
"Worrying about him"

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.420
"Hayama"

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.550
The target has entered his room...

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.090
I'm about to slip in,

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.220
and put the squeeze on the target
until he gives himself up.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.220
I could play the lead role
in a crime drama!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:37.520
N-n-now's n-n-not t-t-the t-t-time,
R-R-Rei-kun...!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:42.820
Good grief, she'd better hurry up.
She's got a magazine interview.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:47.070
C-c-cripes, s-s-stop i-i-it...!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.160
It finally stopped...

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.450
Who are you?

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.330
That voice... Hayama's sister?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.500
As it happens, I'm in the middle of an
investigation of a nutritious character.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.710
What you mean is "suspicious" character.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.460
And besides, you're the
shady-looking one here, you know.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:12.850
Sana-chan!? You're Sana-chan, from
Zenjiro-sensei's Child's Toy, right!?

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.510
It couldn't be mistaken identity...?

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:19.180
What a performer!
Look, it's Sana-chan, all right!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:22.100
Wow, you're as cute as you are on TV!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.190
Thanks...

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.360
What do you want?

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:34.530
Uh, let's see... what do I want...?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.200
Sana-chan doesn't want anything
from the likes of you!

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.290
And what are you doing here, anyway!?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:45.170
Aren't I always telling you not
to come home until my bedtime!?

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.170
Just you being here makes me sick!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.170
Say, get me Zenjiro-san's
autograph, okay?

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.510
Ah, I don't know if I can...

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.180
Please? I'm a fan!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.430
Hurry up and get out of here,
I'm telling you!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.180
I can't stand looking at you!

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.560
I know! Sana-chan,
come have dinner with us!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.850
I'll make it the best that I can.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:08.190
I'm not making anything for you!
Hurry up and go somewhere else!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.530
I'm going! Shut up!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.200
Please, Sana-chan, okay?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:16.530
Ah! I've got to go to work,
so if you'll excuse me...

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.790
Well, remember my autograph, okay?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.420
Haya--

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:40.600
He's going to go eat dinner by himself...

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.140
This week's Sana-chan

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.820
I just knew it...

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.490
You knew what?

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:55.820
Looks like Hayama is a lone wolf
both at home and at school.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:59.240
It's like he doesn't
open his heart to anyone.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:00.990
"Grrrr"

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:05.830
I have lots of people I like,
such as my friends, Mama, and Rei-kun.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.920
But I'm not sure if it's that
he doesn't have anyone like that,

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.510
or if he's just the type that
doesn't have them on purpose.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:14.340
Just thinking that there's
somebody like that...

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:17.010
somehow, more than feeling
upset about him...

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.600
I've started feeling sorry for him...

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:25.850
You've grown up just
the way I idealized.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.270
Mama...

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.820
Sensei, your editor, Onda-san, is here.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.120
Sensei! I can't wait for
your manuscript any longer!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.700
Tell me your favorite color,
favorite drink,

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.490
and a move you're good at.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:46.160
Pink, strong tea,
and the reverse choke-hold.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.120
I see...

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.500
What do you see?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.420
You are someone who says out loud
"give me your manuscript," when actually,

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:54.800
you're a kind person,
who will wait patiently.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.170
M- me...?

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:59.510
Yes. That's what this
personality assessment notebook says.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.100
Are you still caught up in that thing?

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.180
Run away!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:04.470
Sensei!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:07.520
Rei-kun, help me finish
reading through this script.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.150
--Okay.
--You couldn't catch me
in a hundred years!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:13.190
Just kidding! The truth is,
I've already got it done!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.490
What were you thinking!?

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:18.530
This after-dinner exercise
has worked up a good sweat!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:23.540
♪ My own home is so enjoyable... ♪

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:29.170
♪ that I never even thought... ♪

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:38.180
♪ that there were really families
who were that cold to each other... ♪

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:47.480
Being a lone wolf isn't any fun!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.480
♪ Being a lone wolf ♪

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.480
♪ isn't any fun,
it's miserable and lonely! ♪

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.480
♪ Being a lone tanuki or a lone pig ♪

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.150
♪ is fun, happy, and enjoyable! ♪

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.820
Lone pig...

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.780
"Oink."

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.070
I said "lone pig"!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.490
What, do your serious scenes
only go on for a few seconds!?

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:07.410
"That's right."

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.500
Any questions up to this point?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.340
Ah, Mother...?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.180
You're such an idiot, Tsuyoshi!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.520
You called the teacher "Mother"!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.850
Mother! Mother! Mother!

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.850
What is it, Oki-kun?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.190
Um...

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.770
You're overdoing the laughing.
Cut it out.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.150
How can we keep from laughing?

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:40.450
Tsuyoshi really does
have a mother's complex!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:42.780
Has anyone ever seen his mommy?

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:46.790
I have! She looks funny!
She has the same face as he does!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:49.160
This isn't good. I'm getting out of here.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:52.920
She works at that supermarket
in front of the train station,

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.130
wearing those round glasses!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:57.500
"Thank you very much! Thank you very much!
Thank you very much!"

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.130
She always says it three times!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:08.890
Stop badmouthing my mother!!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.820
W- what's going on?
Tsuyoshi-kun is scaring me!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:19.820
Not again...

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.150
How can you look so indifferent!?

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:25.160
He does this about once a year.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.830
He calls the teacher "Mother,"
gets teased, and then snaps.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.830
Oki-kun, it's Mother!
It's Mother! Calm down!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.080
Once he snaps, he's famous
throughout the group

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.460
for being even more
frightening than I am.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.800
You didn't know?

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:42.470
N- no, I didn't. This is the first
time we've been in the same class.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.800
I knew.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.390
Hurry and stop him, Hayama-kun.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.770
It's always your duty to stop him
when this happens, right?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.150
H- he's settled down, right?

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.490
We're going to the nurse's office.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.490
Ah, please do.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.160
Ah, that startled me!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.450
He really does have a
mother's complex, huh?

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.500
H- Hayama...!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.920
What's so wrong about loving
your own mother!? Eh!?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.840
T- there's nothing wrong.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.840
Take it too far, though, and...

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:29.180
And what?

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.180
And, you know,

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.850
that's neither here nor there...

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:41.110
When is this ever going
to be a normal class?

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.780
Sensei, hang in there.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:45.110
Right, right! Don't get discouraged!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:47.110
Thanks, everyone.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.780
"Nurse's Office"

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.450
Are you coming around?

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.120
Yeah... Akito-kun...

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:58.790
Sorry. My chop was too hard.
It's tricky getting the control right.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:03.420
Mm-mm. Thanks, Akito-kun.
Sorry to do this every year.

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:09.140
You do have some good points, Hayama.
My opinion of you has improved a little.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.810
There's nothing wrong with
loving your mother, huh?

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:15.810
I love my Mama, too, after all.

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:16.810
Huh?

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:20.230
I don't remember Hayama
having a mother at his house.

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:22.480
I don't have a father, though.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:26.440
There must be something
going on inside that house.

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:35.830
All these issues...

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.120
are they still piling up!?

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:46.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:51.510
In dire straits,

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:55.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:58.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:04.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:10.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:12.280
...panic!!

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:20.830
he's there.

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:24.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:29.220
...for two.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:32.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:37.390
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:41.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:45.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:51.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:53.990
he's there,

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:57.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:59.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:02.250
...for two.

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.970
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:14.890
How dark, how dark you are Hayama!
What are you, a 20-watt bulb? Geez!

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:15.720
All right!

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.640
Under the circumstances, everything up
to now gets flushed down the toilet,

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:21.310
and Sana-chan is going to
change that light bulb for you!

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:23.020
Next time on Child's Toy, Episode 5

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:26.980
of the Light a Lantern, and Move On
From Being Gloomy and Complaining Saga:

00:24:26.980 --> 00:24:30.320
"Naughty Hayama, Where Are You Going?"

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:33.660
"Naughty Hayama, Where Are You Going?"

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:31.990
How about 200 watts!?

00:24:31.990 --> 00:24:33.660
That would be too bright.
